From d11dccc020acd672b26dbb5041e94897797bcb28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LeoDeadware <351117497+LeoDeadware@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:37:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 16/26] Metal: full mip chains for game textures (LOD bias 0,
 aniso on mipped) - road moire; window activation at start + pads monitored in
 background; RECOMP_GL_DUMP_AT consecutive-frame dumps (v1.0.1)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/apple/apple_main.c                 |   4 +
 src/apple/apple_window.m               |  37 +++++++--
 xboxrecomp/src/nv2a_metal/nv2a_metal.m | 108 ++++++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 131 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/apple/apple_main.c b/src/apple/apple_main.c
